notes.notes:
[b]Gameplay:[/b]

[list]
[*] Exponentiation operation approached in a light way;
[*] Operations can be displayed using the unknown 'X', referring to a first-degree equation;
[*] Fixed: Calculator keys respond faster;
[*] Operational blocks fall a little faster;
[*] New: Error Message Box displayed when making a calculation error;
[*] Improved animation of the Message boxes that show the scores made during the match;
[/list]

[i][Note 01]: [/i]The game's difficulty in general remains calm. With the difficulty slightly increased in the last difficulty levels of the game.

[i][Note 02]:[/i] If this game gathers a certain amount of new players, I would like to bring a new mode that will approach mathematics with a greater difficulty curve and probably in a slightly broader form.

[i][Note 03]:[/i] Combo achievements have had their requirements reduced from (x10, x20, x30, x40) to (x5, x10, x15, x20);

[b]Player Bonus:[/b]

[list]
[*] The bonus for collecting extra coins can now be unlocked in any mode;
[*] NEW: Sound and visual effect when collecting extra bonus coins;
[/list]

[b]Settings:[/b]

[list]
[*] NEW: "Advanced Mode" option. When this mode is activated, the response signal change and confirmation are done automatically.
[/list]

[b]Translations:[/b]

[list]
[*] Reworked Simplified Chinese translation;
[/list]

[b]Guides:[/b]

[list]
[*] Now on the phone icon there is a small guide for beginner players;
[*] NEW: Button for a mini tour added to the game menu. Some areas of the game are presented to the player;
[/list]

Have a good game and a great day! ♥

- [b]Online leaderboard[/b] now correctly displays players from page 2 onwards;
- Player enumeration in the [b]online leaderboard[/b] now starts from "#1";
- Back button re-adjusted in the [b]online leaderboard[/b];

[b]Small update for fixes:[/b]
- Fix for displaying scores in the online leaderboard;
- FrameRate changed from 30 to 60 FPS for more fluidity.
